OL,3,GNEWSAPolice chief calls for clearer
OL,4,Ae-scooter laws
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police chief has said she would like
OL,7,Fthe law clarified around the use of
OL,8,Fe-scooters, describing the current
OL,9,Fsituation as "ambiguous" and "very
OL,10,Fdifficult to enforce".
OL,12,FThe chief constable of Avon and
OL,13,FSomerset Police Sarah Crew has been on
OL,14,FBBC Radio Bristol's hotseat with John
OL,15,FDarvall, answering questions from
OL,16,Flisteners.
OL,18,FThe conversation also covered officer
OL,19,Fnumbers, the early release scheme,
OL,20,Fconcerns around young people wearing
OL,21,Fbalaclavas and the investigation into
OL,22,Fmissing student Jack O'Sullivan.
